# BusGo — QR Ticket Authentication and Wallet System for Public Bus Transport

A production-ready smart bus ticket booking platform with QR-based ticket authentication, digital wallet, real-time GPS tracking, seat selection, and AI-based recommendations.

---

## System Architecture

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     FRONTEND (React)                      │
│  Vite + React 18 + Tailwind CSS + React Router            │
