## Sample API Requests (Postman)

### Register
```json
POST /api/auth/register/
{
    "username": "john",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "password": "securePass123",
    "password2": "securePass123"
}
```

### Login
```json
POST /api/auth/login/
{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "user1234"
}
// Response: { "access": "eyJ...", "refresh": "eyJ..." }
```

### Search Buses
```
GET /api/buses/search/?source=Bangalore&destination=Mysore&date=2026-03-26
```

### Book Ticket
```json
POST /api/bookings/create/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
{
    "schedule_id": 1,
    "seat_numbers": [5, 6]
}
```

### Add Money to Wallet
```json
POST /api/wallet/add-money/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
{
    "amount": 500.00
}
```

### Validate QR Code
```json
POST /api/qr/validate/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
{
    "qr_data": "{\"booking_id\": \"abc-uuid-here\"}"
}
```

