## Key Features Implemented

1. **JWT Authentication** — Login, register, token refresh, role-based access
2. **Bus Search & Booking** — Search by route/date, interactive seat selection, atomic booking
3. **QR Code Tickets** — Auto-generated QR with booking details, downloadable, conductor validation API
4. **Digital Wallet** — Add money, auto-deduction on booking, refund on cancellation, transaction history
5. **GPS Tracking** — Real-time bus locations, Google Maps integration, simulation mode
6. **AI Recommendations** — Frequent routes, preferred seats, booking patterns analysis using Pandas
7. **Admin Panel** — View all bookings/buses/routes/users, QR validation tool
8. **Responsive UI** — Mobile-first design with Tailwind CSS

